        {
          "id": "summary_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "This 3-day plan balances Tokyo's vibrant pop culture with its serene traditions. You'll explore the electric streets of Akihabara, the historic grounds of Asakusa, and the bustling hub of Shinjuku, all while enjoying some of the city's best ramen."
