          "id": "assumptions_text",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "caption",
          "text": "This itinerary assumes you are staying in a central Tokyo location (like Shinjuku or Shibuya) and are comfortable with a moderate amount of walking. The budget is per person and covers food, local transport, and activities, but excludes shopping and accommodation. All prices are estimates and should be verified."
